  "text": "我愿意提供小票。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 19,
  "next": "a4-44"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-44",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "苏桃",
  "actor": "sutao",
  "text": "怎么大家突然都很熟练。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 19,
  "next": "a4-45"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-45",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "许知夏",
  "actor": "zhixia",
  "text": "记录一下实际吃了什么、买起来方不方便、份量是否合适就可以。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 19,
  "next": "a4-46"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-46",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "米粒",
  "actor": "mili",
  "text": "今天早餐吃上了，不过临时遇到一点情况。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 20,
  "next": "a4-47"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-47",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "米粒",
  "actor": "mili",
  "text": "老师让我们提前到教室确认小组汇报顺序，我原来留给吃饭的时间被挤掉了一部分。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 20,
  "next": "a4-48"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-48",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "米粒",
  "actor": "mili",
  "text": "我先吃了一部分，课间再把剩下的吃完。实际时间都记了。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 20,
  "next": "a4-49"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-49",
  "type": "choice",
  "question": "接下来怎么做？",
  "options": [
   {
    "text": "具体是哪一步被挤掉了？我们改一下你的安排。",
    "next": "a4-50"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-50",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "你",
  "actor": null,
  "text": "你觉得原来的份量不够？",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 20,
  "next": "a4-51"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-51",
  "type": "choice",
  "question": "接下来怎么做？",
  "options": [
   {
    "text": "我们把实际份量和全天情况补进你的版本。",
    "next": "a4-52"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-52",
  "type": "choice",
  "question": "接下来怎么做？",
  "options": [
   {
    "text": "我们把当天怎么替换也补进去。",
    "next": "a4-53"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-53",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "米粒",
  "actor": "mili",
  "text": "哪一块是蔬菜来着？",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 20,
  "next": "a4-54"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-54",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "苏桃",
  "actor": "sutao",
  "text": "等会儿拍照，我这次很快。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 20,
  "next": "a4-55"
 },
 {
  "id": "a4-55",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "你",
  "actor": null,
  "text": "那就走吧。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 20,
  "next": "e4_end"
 },
